   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"8\">\n  <li>Large cheese pizzas cost $5 each, and large one-topping pizzas cost $6 each.<br> Choose the equation that represents the total cost, <span data-math=\"T\">T</span>, of <span data-math=\"c\">c</span> large cheese pizzas and <span data-math=\"d\">d</span> large one-topping pizzas.</li>\n</ol>",
   "answers": [
